# citeformer environment variables
#
# Copy to .env and fill in values, then `source .env` (or use direnv / a
# tool like `dotenv`) to load them into your shell. .env is gitignored.
#
# None of these are required for P0 scaffolding. They come online in later
# phases as noted.

# --- P2 + (HF backend) --------------------------------------------------
# Hugging Face token, required only for gated models (Llama 3.2, Gemma, etc.).
# The default example model `microsoft/Phi-3.5-mini-instruct` is open-access
# and does not need a token. Create a token at:
# https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
HF_TOKEN=

# Optional: where HF downloads and caches weights. Defaults to ~/.cache/huggingface.
# Pointing at a shared path keeps multiple citeformer projects from re-downloading.
# HUGGINGFACE_HUB_CACHE=

# --- P4 + (Crossref metadata fetcher) -----------------------------------
# Polite-pool email for Crossref's REST API. Not required, but including
# one puts requests in Crossref's fast lane and is good API citizenship.
# See: https://api.crossref.org/swagger-ui/index.html#tips
# CITEFORMER_CROSSREF_MAILTO=
